cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Kapso in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Kapso: an engine that runs experiments, deploys the best solution and learns from every run"
abstract: >-
  Kapso is an open-source engine that runs experiments, deploys the best
  solution and learns from every run. Given an objective, initial success
  criteria and evaluation metrics, it runs experiments on a tree of
  experiments, choosing each next idea from previous experiments and its bank
  of lessons, deploys the best solution on the desired stack, and learns from
  each run into lessons with a credence score and a boundary on where they
  apply; domain knowledge goes in through a harness.
